      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anytime"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いつでも大丈夫。済ませるまで今日の予定に残ります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anytime is fine. Stays in today’s list until done. "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いつでも大丈夫（時刻は決めない）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anytime (no set time)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いまの中身も控えに残すので、やり直せます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The current data is also backed up, so you can undo this."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いまは「%@」の時間です": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Time for “%@”"
