      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "None"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "なにをしていたか（短くでOK）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What were you doing? (keep it short)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ほかの端末と": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Other Devices"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ほかの端末と揃えるとき、この端末の中身を書き換える直前の控えを%lld件 残しています。記録が思っていたものと違うときは、ここから戻せます。戻す前の中身も控えに残すので、やり直せます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Before syncing overwrites this device’s data, a backup is kept (%lld so far). If your records look wrong, you can restore from here. The current data is backed up before restoring, so you can undo it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "またひとつ前に進みました": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One more step forward"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "まもなく「%@」の時間です": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is coming up"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "もしものとき": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Just in Case"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "やめる": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "やること": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What to do"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "カレンダー": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calendar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ブラウジング": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Browsing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "マス1つが1日。縦が日〜土、横が週で、右端の列が今週です。色が付いた日が「できた」日。マスを押すと、その日の記録をすぐ下で付けられます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each square is a day. Rows are Sun–Sat, columns are weeks, and the rightmost column is this week. Colored squares are days you got it done. Tap a square to record that day right below."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ラベル": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Labels"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ラベルの名前": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Label name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ラベルを整える…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Edit labels…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ラベルを消しても、予定と記録は残ります。その予定は「ラベルなし」に戻ります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deleting a label keeps its plans and records. Those plans go back to “No label”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ラベルを足す": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add label"
          }
        }
